I sit at my desk.
My notebook is on the desk.
I take a pen.
My kitchen is empty.
I write a list of things.
First, I want rice.
I also like yellow dal.
So I write rice and yellow dal on the paper.
I also want vegetables.
I like tomatoes.
So I write tomatoes and spinach.
Finally, I want spices.
There are no spices in my kitchen.
I write the spices on the paper too.
I like sweet things.
So I want sugar too.
Now my list is complete.
I take my bag.
Now I go to the shop.
